    "q-34389": {
      "dom_id": "step-q34389",
      "name": "Question 15",
      "problem": "Using the cross product curvature formula, find the curvature of $r(t)=⟨2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,3\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩$ as a function of $t.$",
      "worked_solution": "The curvature $κ$ is given by\n\n$$\nκ(t)=\\frac{‖{r}^{′}(t)\\times {r}^{″}(t)‖}{‖{r}^{′}(t){‖}^{3}}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we calculate ${r}^{′}(t)$ and $‖{r}^{′}(t)‖$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =⟨2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t),3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)⟩=⟨2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩ \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{(2cos)^{2}+(-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)^{2}}=\\sqrt{4{cos}^{2}⁡t+9{sin}^{2}⁡t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we find the second derivative:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{″}(t) & =⟨2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t),-3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)⟩=⟨-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we compute the cross product by considering ${r}^{′}(t)$ and ${r}^{″}(t)$ as $3$-dimensional vectors with zero $z$-components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t)\\times {r}^{″}(t) & =⟨2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,0⟩\\times ⟨0,\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,0⟩ \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t & -3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t & 0 \\\\ -2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t & -3\\operatorname{cos}⁡t & 0\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t & -3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t \\\\ -2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t & -3\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,k \\\\  & =(-6{cos}^{2}⁡t-6{sin}^{2}⁡t)\\,k \\\\  & =-6\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the magnitude of the cross product is\n\n$$\n‖{r}^{′}(t)\\times {r}^{″}(t)‖=6.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the curvature is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}κ(t) & =\\frac{‖{r}^{′}(t)\\times {r}^{″}(t)‖}{‖{r}^{′}(t){‖}^{3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{(\\sqrt{4{cos}^{2}⁡t+9{sin}^{2}⁡t})^{3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{(4{cos}^{2}⁡t+9{sin}^{2}⁡t)^{3/2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-34389-a",
